> Like, how do you get a wish from quaffing at fountains?  Everytime a
> water elemental comes out, I usually die from it.  Not to mention nymphs.

The chance of you getting a wish is 20% - the dungeon level, so it's
probably not worth quaffing on any but the first levels.  (I personally
*never* quaff, I typically need to #dip things for uncursing and/or holy
water manufacture, but play the game your way...)
  
> How about from smoky potions or lamps?  Should I get them blessed or
> something.

Definitely.  Blessed magic lamps or smoky potions will always give you a
wish (if the genie appears from the potion, anyway).  If the item was
uncursed, you may get a wish (but the odds are bad); and if the item was
cursed, you never get a wish

